title: ecg-physionet-robustness-benchmark
type: software
version: 1.0.0
description: >-
  ECG-ROBUST — patient-independent ECG arrhythmia classification and
  noise-robustness benchmark (AAMI N/S/V/F/Q) on the official PhysioNet
  MIT-BIH Arrhythmia and Noise Stress Test Databases.
repository: https://github.com/yazanus94-dot/ecg-physionet-robustness-benchmark
